{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ae22b065-7570-4133-8dc1-09b347f1b980","step":{"id":"s1","script":"The rectangle represents all possible outcomes. Circles A and B represent two events; their overlap contains outcomes belonging to both.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Union of two events"},{"op":"figure","id":"venn","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-4,4],"y":[-2.8,2.8],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"polyline","id":"sample","points":[[-3.7,-2.4],[3.7,-2.4],[3.7,2.4],[-3.7,2.4]],"closed":true},{"kind":"circle","id":"event_a","center":[-1,0],"r":1.7},{"kind":"circle","id":"event_b","center":[1,0],"r":1.7},{"kind":"text","at":[-1.5,1.95],"text":"A"},{"kind":"text","at":[1.5,1.95],"text":"B"},{"kind":"text","at":[-3.3,2],"text":"S"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ae22b065-7570-4133-8dc1-09b347f1b980","step":{"id":"s2","script":"The union includes everything in A or B, including their overlap. Shade both circles, leaving the outside unshaded.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"union_shade","on":"venn","marks":[{"kind":"shade","inside":"event_a"},{"kind":"shade","inside":"event_b","except":["event_a"]}]},{"op":"equation","id":"union_symbol","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"A\\cup B"},{"op":"text","id":"union_meaning","anchor":{"el":"union_symbol","side":"below","gap":0.08},"content":"In A or B, or both"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ae22b065-7570-4133-8dc1-09b347f1b980","step":{"id":"s3","script":"An outcome in the overlap belongs to the union too. It is included once, not excluded and not counted twice.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"outcomes","on":"venn","marks":[{"kind":"point","at":[-2,0],"label":"A only"},{"kind":"point","id":"shared","at":[0,0],"label":"both"},{"kind":"point","at":[2,0],"label":"B only"}]},{"op":"text","id":"overlap_note","anchor":{"el":"union_meaning","side":"below","gap":0.1},"content":"Include the overlap once"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"An outcome belongs to both A and B. Is it in their union?","expected_gist":"Yes; the union includes outcomes in either event or both."}}}
